	/* Delif's Cube	|1
	 * Artifact
	 * |2, |T: This turn, when target creature you control attacks and isn't blocked, it assigns no combat damage this turn and you put a cube counter on ~.
	 * |2, Remove a cube counter from ~: Regenerate target creature. */

